-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"0621cba3-b65f-4131-bcf5-be7755963edb\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"273\"><strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"153\">Elite Coders CodeSprint 2026</strong>&nbsp; hosted on <strong>Unstop</strong>, is a month-long open-source building challenge designed to take participants from <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"272\">Idea &rarr; MVP &rarr; Open Source &rarr; Pitch</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"498\">Participants will build their projects online from <strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"360\">15 October to 15 November 2026</strong>, with mentorship and project reviews throughout the build phase. The strongest projects will be shortlisted for the final pitching round.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"702\">The <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"526\">Final Pitching Day</strong> will be held <strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"583\">offline in Dehradun on 22 November 2026</strong>, where selected finalists will present their projects to judges and compete for cash prizes, swag, and special awards.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1svcp4u\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"725\"><strong>What You'll Do:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"1024\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1syjcvf\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"769\">Submit and develop your original idea</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q1jlzl\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"827\">Build a functional MVP during the online build phase</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1zsos6\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"862\">Make your project open source</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9f09yc\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"898\">&zwj; Get mentorship and feedback</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"af9yxy\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"936\">Deploy and showcase your project</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7oupqx\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"980\">Qualify through the final shortlisting</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c5ge9b\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1024\">Pitch your product offline in Dehradun</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1sdq4uw\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1040\"><strong>Rewards:</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1069\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1069\">₹30,000 Cash Prize Pool</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1144\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1e9019l\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1095\">1st Place &mdash; ₹15,000</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p60bd9\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1120\">2nd Place &mdash; ₹10,000</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"uf2qh1\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1144\">3rd Place &mdash; ₹5,000</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1177\"><strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1177\">Special Awards + Swag Kits:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1319\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1x6bm7q\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1190\">Best UI/UX</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pgmo94\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1220\">Best Social Welfare Project</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fmqxl7\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1241\">Best Beginner Team</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qv6iac\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1268\">Best Open Source Project</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"148rbt4\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1301\">Best Use of Sponsor Technology</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rmwqsl\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1319\">Best Innovation</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1387\">Swag/rewards will be provided to all members of winning teams.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1d4w5ke\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1405\"><strong>Key Dates:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1425\">Registrations:</strong> 26 September 2026 onwards</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1471\">Online Build:</strong> 15 October &ndash; 15 November 2026</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1527\">Final Shortlisting:</strong> After the build phase</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1568\">Final Pitch:</strong> 22 November 2026</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1598\">Venue:</strong> Dehradun, Uttarakhand</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"4a7ppg\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1642\"><strong>The Challenge:</strong></p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1687\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1687\"><strong data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1687\">One Month to Build. One Day to Pitch.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1779\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Take your idea from concept to a working, open-source MVP and bring it to the final stage.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
